,{"text":"工回한司","words":[{"text":"工回한司","x":1195,"y":641,"width":159,"height":64}]},{"text":"데이터","words":[{"text":"데이터","x":1291,"y":728,"width":55,"height":23}]},{"text":"록의 주소를 저장한다. 마지막 포인터는 삼중 간접 블록(triple indirect block)의","words":[{"text":"록의","x":350,"y":1301,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"주소를","x":424,"y":1302,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"저장한다.","x":528,"y":1300,"width":121,"height":35},{"text":"마지막","x":665,"y":1300,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"포인터는","x":768,"y":1301,"width":123,"height":35},{"text":"삼중","x":903,"y":1300,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"간접","x":980,"y":1299,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"블록(triple","x":1057,"y":1299,"width":170,"height":40},{"text":"indirect","x":1243,"y":1301,"width":131,"height":28},{"text":"block)의","x":1389,"y":1299,"width":128,"height":36}]},{"text":"주소를 저장한다. UNIX inode가 그림 14.8에 나와 있다.","words":[{"text":"주소를","x":351,"y":1361,"width":90,"height":33},{"text":"저장한다.","x":452,"y":1358,"width":121,"height":35},{"text":"UNIX","x":585,"y":1361,"width":89,"height":28},{"text":"inode가","x":685,"y":1359,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"그림","x":813,"y":1359,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"14.8에","x":885,"y":1358,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"나와","x":990,"y":1358,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":1067,"y":1357,"width":69,"height":35}]},{"text":"이 기법을 쓸 경우 많은 운영체제가 시용하고 있는 4바이트 파일 포인터가 가리","words":[{"text":"이","x":389,"y":1417,"width":25,"height":35},{"text":"기법을","x":432,"y":1417,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"쓸","x":530,"y":1417,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"경우","x":574,"y":1417,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"많은","x":645,"y":1416,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"운영체제가","x":716,"y":1416,"width":153,"height":35},{"text":"시용하고","x":881,"y":1416,"width":126,"height":35},{"text":"있는","x":1023,"y":1416,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"4바이트","x":1098,"y":1416,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"파일","x":1233,"y":1417,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"포인터가","x":1315,"y":1414,"width":133,"height":36},{"text":"가리","x":1462,"y":1414,"width":55,"height":36}]},{"text":"길 수 있는 블록 보다 더 많은 블록을 할당할 수 있다. 파일 포인터가 32비트일 경우","words":[{"text":"길","x":353,"y":1476,"width":25,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":390,"y":1476,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"있는","x":434,"y":1475,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"블록","x":500,"y":1475,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"보다","x":570,"y":1474,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"더","x":641,"y":1474,"width":24,"height":35},{"text":"많은","x":680,"y":1474,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"블록을","x":750,"y":1474,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"할당할","x":853,"y":1474,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":957,"y":1474,"width":33,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":1003,"y":1473,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"파일","x":1086,"y":1473,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"포인터가","x":1164,"y":1474,"width":137,"height":35},{"text":"32비트일","x":1312,"y":1472,"width":136,"height":36},{"text":"경우","x":1463,"y":1472,"width":59,"height":35}]},{"text":"232 즉 4기가바이트를 주소 지정할 수 있다. 많은 UNIX와 Linux 구현들은 이제 64","words":[{"text":"232","x":349,"y":1531,"width":42,"height":34},{"text":"즉","x":401,"y":1535,"width":31,"height":32},{"text":"4기가바이트를","x":440,"y":1533,"width":195,"height":34},{"text":"주소","x":644,"y":1534,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"지정할","x":716,"y":1532,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":816,"y":1532,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":860,"y":1532,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"많은","x":939,"y":1531,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"UNIX와","x":1012,"y":1531,"width":132,"height":34},{"text":"Linux","x":1153,"y":1534,"width":102,"height":28},{"text":"구현들은","x":1267,"y":1532,"width":136,"height":34},{"text":"이제","x":1416,"y":1531,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"64","x":1489,"y":1535,"width":33,"height":27}]},{"text":"비트 파일 포인터를 지원하고 있다. 이들 포인터는 엑사바이트 수준의 파일과 파일","words":[{"text":"비트","x":352,"y":1593,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"파일","x":422,"y":1591,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"포인터를","x":493,"y":1592,"width":118,"height":33},{"text":"지원하고","x":625,"y":1590,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":757,"y":1589,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"이들","x":839,"y":1590,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"포인터는","x":912,"y":1589,"width":127,"height":34},{"text":"엑사바이트","x":1053,"y":1589,"width":165,"height":34},{"text":"수준의","x":1232,"y":1590,"width":98,"height":34},{"text":"파일과","x":1349,"y":1589,"width":100,"height":34},{"text":"파일","x":1462,"y":1589,"width":58,"height":35}]},{"text":"시스템을 허용한다. 그림 14.9는 UNIX에서 시용되는 inode를 보인다.","words":[{"text":"시스템을","x":352,"y":1649,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"허용한다.","x":480,"y":1649,"width":121,"height":35},{"text":"그림","x":614,"y":1648,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"14.9는","x":684,"y":1649,"width":91,"height":32},{"text":"UNIX에서","x":784,"y":1647,"width":150,"height":35},{"text":"시용되는","x":949,"y":1647,"width":128,"height":35},{"text":"inode를","x":1087,"y":1648,"width":131,"height":33},{"text":"보인다.","x":1229,"y":1647,"width":109,"height":35}]},{"text":"색인 할당 기법은 연결 할당과 동일한 성능 문제를 갖는다. 특히 색인 블록은 메모리","words":[{"text":"색인","x":351,"y":1768,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"할당","x":420,"y":1767,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"기법은","x":490,"y":1767,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"연결","x":590,"y":1766,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"할당과","x":657,"y":1764,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"동일한","x":757,"y":1764,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"성능","x":860,"y":1765,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"문제를","x":931,"y":1763,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"갖는다.","x":1037,"y":1763,"width":104,"height":35},{"text":"특히","x":1156,"y":1764,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"색인","x":1236,"y":1765,"width":68,"height":34},{"text":"블록은","x":1317,"y":1765,"width":101,"height":34},{"text":"메모리","x":1430,"y":1764,"width":89,"height":35}]},{"text":"에 개시될 수 있지만 데이터 블록은 전체 볼륨 파티션 전체에 널리 퍼져 있을 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"에","x":296,"y":1828,"width":26,"height":34},{"text":"개시될","x":336,"y":1826,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":434,"y":1825,"width":30,"height":35},{"text":"있지만","x":476,"y":1825,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"데이터","x":573,"y":1824,"width":83,"height":36},{"text":"블록은","x":670,"y":1823,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"전체","x":772,"y":1822,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"볼륨","x":841,"y":1823,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"파티션","x":913,"y":1822,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"전체에","x":1020,"y":1821,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"널리","x":1128,"y":1822,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"퍼져","x":1208,"y":1822,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"있을","x":1288,"y":1822,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1366,"y":1822,"width":34,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":1414,"y":1821,"width":68,"height":35}]},{"text":"14.4.4 성능 Performance","words":[{"text":"14.4.4","x":294,"y":1935,"width":133,"height":29},{"text":"성능","x":464,"y":1934,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"Performance","x":541,"y":1942,"width":178,"height":21}]},{"text":"위에서 논의한 할당 방법들은 공간 효율성과 데이터 블록 접근 시간이 다양하다. 두 요","words":[{"text":"위에서","x":296,"y":2005,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"논의한","x":396,"y":2005,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"할당","x":497,"y":2005,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"방법들은","x":568,"y":2003,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"공간","x":698,"y":2003,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"효율성과","x":771,"y":2003,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"데이터","x":908,"y":2003,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"블록","x":1013,"y":2003,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"접근","x":1093,"y":2003,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"시간이","x":1172,"y":2002,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"다양하다.","x":1288,"y":2001,"width":142,"height":37},{"text":"두","x":1447,"y":2003,"width":33,"height":33},{"text":"요","x":1493,"y":2003,"width":29,"height":28}]},{"text":"소 모두 중요한 선택 기준이 된다.","words":[{"text":"소","x":294,"y":2066,"width":30,"height":27},{"text":"모두","x":334,"y":2065,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"중요한","x":403,"y":2063,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"선택","x":503,"y":2063,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"기준이","x":572,"y":2062,"width":84,"height":36},{"text":"된다.","x":671,"y":2062,"width":65,"height":34}]},{"text":"할당 방법을 선택하기 전에, 중요한 것은 시스템들이 어떤 목적을 위해 시용되느나","words":[{"text":"할당","x":350,"y":2121,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"방법을","x":421,"y":2121,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"선택하기","x":523,"y":2121,"width":113,"height":35},{"text":"전에,","x":654,"y":2121,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"중요한","x":733,"y":2121,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"것은","x":838,"y":2121,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"시스템들이","x":912,"y":2121,"width":152,"height":35},{"text":"어떤","x":1083,"y":2122,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"목적을","x":1161,"y":2121,"width":102,"height":35},{"text":"위해","x":1279,"y":2121,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"시용되느나","x":1361,"y":2120,"width":162,"height":35}]},{"text":"를 아는 것이다. 순자 접근을 주로 하는 시스템은 랜덤 접근을 주로 하는 시스템과는 전","words":[{"text":"를","x":294,"y":2181,"width":30,"height":33},{"text":"아는","x":336,"y":2178,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"것이다.","x":408,"y":2178,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"순자","x":514,"y":2180,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"접근을","x":588,"y":2179,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"주로","x":686,"y":2181,"width":61,"height":33},{"text":"하는","x":758,"y":2179,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"시스템은","x":831,"y":2180,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"랜덤","x":965,"y":2179,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"접근을","x":1040,"y":2179,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"주로","x":1149,"y":2182,"width":67,"height":34},{"text":"하는","x":1230,"y":2180,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"시스템과는","x":1313,"y":2178,"width":167,"height":37},{"text":"전","x":1493,"y":2178,"width":28,"height":35}]},{"text":"혀 다른 할당 방법을 A卜\u0026할 것이다.","words":[{"text":"혀","x":296,"y":2238,"width":24,"height":34},{"text":"다른","x":334,"y":2237,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"할당","x":403,"y":2236,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"방법을","x":473,"y":2237,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"A卜\u0026할","x":573,"y":2237,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"것이다.","x":674,"y":2237,"width":93,"height":35}]},{"text":"모든 유형의 액세스에 대해 연속 할당은 블록을 얻기 위해 한 번의 액세스만 필요하","words":[{"text":"모든","x":349,"y":2296,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"유형의","x":418,"y":2294,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"액세스에","x":521,"y":2295,"width":115,"height":35},{"text":"대해","x":651,"y":2295,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"연속","x":723,"y":2295,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"할당은","x":791,"y":2295,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"블록을","x":892,"y":2294,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"얻기","x":998,"y":2295,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"위해","x":1072,"y":2296,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"한","x":1150,"y":2297,"width":34,"height":33},{"text":"번의","x":1197,"y":2296,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"액세스만","x":1278,"y":2297,"width":136,"height":35},{"text":"필요하","x":1428,"y":2297,"width":95,"height":35}]}]}